# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your key. NEVER commit the real .env.
#
# Get a free Gemini API key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# The SAME key is used two places:
#   1. Locally in this .env — so `npm run regenerate` can build transcripts,
#      show notes, clips, and the search index.
#   2. In Vercel's Environment Variables (Project → Settings → Environment
#      Variables) — so the live /api/ask search works. Add it there too.
#
# The key is only ever read by the build script and the serverless function.
# It is NEVER included in any browser/client code.

GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
